Package: runnerscope
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, fontconfig, ca-certificates
Description: native GitHub Actions self-hosted runner desktop monitor
 RunnerScope is a native C desktop application linked directly to the
 pinned Libraries library. Linux uses GTK for its native desktop shell.
 GitHub requests and JSON decoding run inside the application. The Linux package
 includes the Common-verified MB Corpo faces and product-local bitmap artwork.
